---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Data Sources & Methodology — HormuzTracker.tech" description="Learn about the data sources, methodology, and accuracy behind HormuzTracker.tech's Strait of Hormuz crisis monitoring." path="/data">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 space-y-6">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Data Sources & Methodology</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">How we collect, verify, and present Strait of Hormuz crisis data</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Data Sources -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Data Sources</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-4">HormuzTracker.tech aggregates data from multiple publicly available and proprietary sources to provide the most accurate picture of the Strait of Hormuz crisis. All data is cross-referenced and validated before publication.</p>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ops-700/30">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-crisis-blue"></span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">AIS Vessel Tracking</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Real-time ship positions, transit counts, and vessel identification data aggregated from AIS (Automatic Identification System) feeds covering the Strait of Hormuz and surrounding waters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ops-700/30">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-crisis-orange"></span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Energy Market Data</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Oil and energy commodity prices including Brent Crude, WTI, TTF Natural Gas, and US Gasoline from established energy market data providers and exchanges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ops-700/30">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-crisis-red"></span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Maritime Intelligence</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Vessel seizure reports, P&I club war risk advisories, carrier rerouting notices, and insurance premium updates sourced from maritime security firms and insurance market reports.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ops-700/30">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-crisis-amber"></span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Geopolitical Analysis</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Timeline events, diplomatic developments, and escalation indicators compiled from news agencies, government briefings, and think-tank publications specializing in Middle East security.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Data Accuracy -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Data Accuracy & Limitations</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-3">While we strive for accuracy, all data presented on HormuzTracker.tech should be considered estimated and for informational purposes only. Key limitations include:</p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-slate-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>AIS data may not capture vessels with transponders disabled or operating in areas of poor satellite coverage</li>
        <li>Oil prices reflect market conditions at the time of data collection and may differ from current trading prices</li>
        <li>Insurance premium estimates are based on industry reports and may vary by vessel type, flag, and cargo</li>
        <li>Transit counts are approximate and may differ from official port authority statistics</li>
        <li>Timeline events are compiled from public sources and may not reflect the complete picture of ongoing diplomatic or military activities</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Attribution -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Attribution</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Data presented on HormuzTracker.tech is licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" class="text-crisis-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)</a>. You are free to share and adapt the data for any purpose, including commercial use, provided you give appropriate credit to HormuzTracker.tech and link to the license.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3">Suggested attribution: "Data from HormuzTracker.tech, licensed under CC BY 4.0"</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
